{"3310320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cacotopia", "steam_appid": 3310320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS set in a dystopian cyberpunk world where the tyrannical powers-that-be control the masses by a robot police force after a people's revolt was joined by the former human police force. Unique physics-based gameplay, combining pool with FPS, and the ability to kill your enemies by trick shots. Use secondary ammo to turn objects in the world into a fiery inferno, an EMP weapon that stuns your enemies, a bomb, or magnetic - or combinations of these.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS set in a dystopian cyberpunk world where the tyrannical powers-that-be control the masses by a robot police force after a people's revolt was joined by the former human police force. Unique physics-based gameplay, combining pool with FPS, and the ability to kill your enemies by trick shots. Use secondary ammo to turn objects in the world into a fiery inferno, an EMP weapon that stuns your enemies, a bomb, or magnetic - or combinations of these.</p>", "short_description": "FPS where physics matter to the gameplay, fusing FPS with elements of pool. Do trick shots to take out your enemies, or use special ammo to set objects in the world on fire, make them EMP charged, explosive or magnetic - or combinations thereof to overcome your foes. Think and act fast!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310320/header.jpg?t=1757178727", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310320/8a3a9bfde5393a84f3677ee493c5ed003cf18f73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757178727", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310320/8a3a9bfde5393a84f3677ee493c5ed003cf18f73/capsul